    "notes": [
      "Introduces the deterministic packaged Knowledge Pack Manifest Schema v2 contract for FR-06 while retaining v1 persistence compatibility.",
      "Schema v2 covers pack identity/layer, canonical applicability, KPIs, evidence rules, Opportunity patterns, execution templates, measurement suggestions, seasonality and guardrails.",
      "MVP packs remain backend-packaged and provider-neutral; no remote installation or private connector is introduced.",
      "The direct certified VS-15 dependency is retained as required by integrated MVP acceptance while VS-17 is the immediate predecessor.",
      "No database migration, release, deployment or production enablement is authorized by VS-18."
    ]
  },
